        <p>You don't need to know how to pose. I'll help with where to put your hands, where to look and how to move, with time to try things and find what feels like you. Before we meet, I'll share my free posing guide so you can pick a few ideas you love.</p>
        <p class="photographer-intro__languages">We can plan and shoot in <strong>English, Italian or Russian.</strong></p>
        <a class="photography-link" href="#posing-guide">Take a look at the posing guide <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

