            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i> Flexible timing</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-half-stroke"></i> 3 black &amp; white edits included</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"></i> 3 express previews within 24h</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-map"></i> Off-the-beaten-path locations</li>
