      </div>
      <details>
        <summary>Will you help me if I don't know how to pose?</summary>
        <p>Yes. I'll guide you throughout the session, from where to put your hands to small changes in posture, gaze and movement. No modeling experience is needed. You can browse <a href={photography.poseGuideUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">my free PhotoPoses guide</a> before we meet, but there's nothing you need to memorize.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Where on the Amalfi Coast can we take photos?</summary>
        <p>I'm based in Atrani and photograph in Amalfi, Ravello, Positano, Maiori and Tramonti too. Atrani and Amalfi are included in the base travel zone; other towns have the travel fees listed above. We'll choose a route together based on the light, your preferences and how much you'd like to walk.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>How much does a photoshoot with Greg cost?</summary>
        <p>Base solo packages are €{photographyPackages.portrait.price} for about 45 minutes with 25+ retouched photos, or €{photographyPackages.coastal.price} for about 1.5 hours with 50+ photos. Couple packages are €{photographyPackages.golden.price} for about one hour with 40+ photos, or €{photographyPackages.panorama.price} for about two hours with 80+ photos. Travel fees, add-ons and seasonal offers are listed on this page. <a href="#pricing">Compare the packages.</a></p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Can I book through Airbnb, Localgrapher or GetYourGuide?</summary>
        <p>Yes. You can find my photography on <a href={photography.airbnbUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Airbnb</a>, my photographer profile on <a href={photography.localgrapherUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Localgrapher</a>, and my sunrise photo walk on <a href={photography.getYourGuideUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GetYourGuide</a>. You can also <a href="/contact#contact-form">book directly with me</a>. Check the package and terms on your chosen platform, as they may differ from direct bookings.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>Which languages do you speak, and when will I receive my photos?</summary>
        <p>I speak English, Italian and Russian. Standard delivery is within 7 business days, through a private online gallery with 90 days to download your edited, high-resolution JPEGs.</p>
      </details>
      <details>
        <summary>What happens if it rains on the day?</summary>
        <p>If rain affects our shoot, we can reschedule for free. We'll stay in touch about the forecast and agree on a new time together.</p>
      </details>
